d 'VALIDEMAIL': module to email validation via Regex, DNS/MX Check, and Disposable Domain Detection
d
d  validemail provides a multi-stage validation for email address
d variables. It performs Regex format checks, Disposable email
d detection, and DNS/MX record verification. 
d
d KW: email; data validation; data cleaning; DNS
d
d Requires: Stata version 14.0
d
d Distribution-Date: 20261114
d
d Author: Eric Booth, Texas 2036
d Support: email eric.a.booth@@gmail.com
d
f validemail.ado
f validemail.sthlp
